    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daudi yamenya mubaFilisiti",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Daudi nasunga mumwoyokwe ari Kho enduutsi mbu inyanga yindi ndalatiba khulwa omukhono kwaSaulo; libulaho lilayi khwisie ta, habula okhwilukha enzie mushialo shiabaFilisiti; mana Saulo alarusiakhwo omwoyo oburakhaaba khandi munzakho tsiaIsiraeli ta; kho mana ndihonokoshe mumukhonokwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho Daudi narula nabira, nende aba yali ninabo ebikhumi bisasaba, nibatsia ewaAkhishi waMaokhi, omuruchi waGatsi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Daudi namenya ewaAkhishi eGatsi, ye nende abandube, buli mundu nende abeinzuye, naye Daudi nende abakhasibe babili, mbu Ahinoamu omuYezereel ioyo, nende Abigaili omuKarameli, ousika Nabali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikaboolelwa Saulo shinga Daudi olwa yali niyeelushiile Gatsi; naye naramukhaaba khandi ta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Daudi nasunjila Akhishi an Bulaano, nimba ninyoolile obukoosia mumonitsio, chama bambeelesie habundu mwitaala lindi lielwanyi, emenyeyo; okhuba nishiina eshiakhachila omusumbawo amenye mwitookho halala ninawe? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana Akhishi namuheelesia Zikilagi inyanga eyo; niko akachila Zikilagi nomwandu kwabaruchi baYuda okhuula olwa leelo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne tsindaalo etsia Daudi yamenya mushialo shiabaFilisiti tsiali omuyika omulamba nende emiesi chine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Daudi nende abandube bali nibatikulukhanga nibaseera eshialo shiabaGeshuri, nende abaGirizi, nende abaAmaleki, nibabayaaya; okhuba abandu abo nibo abalinji nibamenyanga mushialo eshio okhurula khale, okutsia eShuru okhuula khushialo shiaMisiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi yarootsanga eshialo, narahonokosia omundu kata omusaatsa kata omukhasi abe mwoyo ta, nayaaya amakondi kosi netsing'ombe, netsisishili, netsingamia, nende ebiifwalo biosi; mana yakalukhanga niyoola ewaAkhishi ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Akhishi nareebanga mbu Museerile heena leelo? Daudi nasunganga mbu Khuseerile khuNegebu ewaYuda, kata mbu Negebu ewabaYerameeli, kata mbu Negebu ewabaKeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne Daudi shiyahonokosinjia omundu kata omusaatsa kata omukhasi abe mwoyo, mbu abaleere eGatsi ta; ari Baleshe okhukhubuula, bari Nolwa Daudi yakholile; khandi nolwa yakholanga tsindaalo tsiosi olwa yalinji namenyile mushibala shiabaFilisiti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 27:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Akhishi yamusuubilila Daudi, ari Aka akholile kachilile nabasinyila elala abandu babwe Isiraeli; khulwako alabeetsanga omusumba wanie obushia nobushia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.27.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.27.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
